SOCRATIC TUTOR █
THESIS PROJECT [JAVA / VAADIN / SPRING AI]

~~~

AUTHORS: MANUEL RODRIGUEZ + CRISTIAN DE LA HOZ
PURPOSE: AI-ASSISTED SOCRATIC LEARNING
STATUS: IN DEVELOPMENT

~~~

ABOUT:

Socratic Tutor is our thesis project: a learning platform that guides
students through questions instead of giving direct answers.

It combines conversational AI, academic context, tenant-aware workspaces,
and professor tools for shaping how tutoring happens.

~~~

FOCUS:
 - Socratic dialogue
 - Course-aware tutoring
 - Professor-controlled context
 - Local inference experiments
